{
    "_help": [
        "Example of a custom quiz config for the Creature Quiz (index.php?pg=pkmn-quiz).",
        "Same format as harmontide-gen.json: categories with entries.",
        "An entry is either a plain string (\"Kraken\") or an object for extras:",
        "  { \"en\": \"Polar Bear\", \"de\": \"Eisbär\", \"aliases\": [\"bear\"], \"sprite\": \"custom_name\" }",
        "The file name prefix decides the sprite path: harmontide-* uses images/creatures/,",
        "any other prefix uses images/games/<prefix>/<en name, lowercased, only a-z0-9>.png (shown at 50x50)."
    ],
